cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "Amblyopia Plasticity Analysis"
abstract: >-
  Analysis code for a study of visual plasticity in adult amblyopia,
  combining psychophysics, dichoptic VR-based perceptual training and
  MR spectroscopy (GABA+/Glx). Includes processing modules, analysis
  notebooks and synthetic example data.
authors:
  - family-names: Fars
    given-names: Julien
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-7771-5029"
    affiliation: University of Oxford
repository-code: "https://github.com/julienfars/Amblyopia_plasticity_analysis"
license:
  - MIT
  - CC-BY-4.0
keywords:
  - amblyopia
  - visual plasticity
  - psychophysics
  - virtual reality
  - MR spectroscopy
  - GABA
